    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d29">

                <pb facs="0047" n="35" sameAs="frus:frus1942v01/pg35"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/18691a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)<anchor n="61"
                        xml:id="d29-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-01-17T23:00:00-05:00">January 17, 1942—11
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>204. Please transmit to Zog I King of the Albanians the following message: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Your cable of January 6<anchor n="62" xml:id="d29-f2"/> has been
                            received with appreciation and I reciprocate your hope for the triumph
                            of human rights and international justice. Franklin D. Roosevelt.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>You may add verbally that as yet no procedure has been established for adherence
                    to the principles of the Declaration by United Nations for other than
                    governments but that note has been taken of his request.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d29-f1" n="61" type="source" xml:id="d29-f1-content">
                <p>Marginal note: “OK FDR.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d29-f2" n="62" xml:id="d29-f2-content">
                <p>Sent direct to the President.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
